WEBVTT

00:16:57.131 --> 00:17:00.374
That goes along with the sense
of spirituality and supernatural,

00:17:00.398 --> 00:17:03.837
that the human contribution is the labor;
that's what we can do.

00:17:03.861 --> 00:17:08.211
And I learned very early on,
it became incredibly clear to me

00:17:08.235 --> 00:17:10.776
that there are three factors
that I was going to need

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.908
in order to be successful as an artist.

00:17:12.932 --> 00:17:14.583
One of them was luck,

00:17:14.607 --> 00:17:15.925
the other one was talent,

00:17:15.949 --> 00:17:18.134
and the other one was hard work.

00:17:18.158 --> 00:17:22.345
Luck is predetermined
by forces far outside of my --

00:17:22.369 --> 00:17:24.275
I mean, nobody understand what luck is.

00:17:24.299 --> 00:17:27.923
We understand talent better
than we understand what luck is.

00:17:27.947 --> 00:17:29.672
I don't know how to control luck.

00:17:29.696 --> 00:17:31.837
I certainly don't know
how to control talent,